 "words_heard": 221,
 "words": 240,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Valley of Elah, two armies on the hills",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nine foot giant talking big, giving everybody chills",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Forty days he shouted, send a man to fight me",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saul's whole army shaking, nobody stepping up to try me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a shepherd boy came down with bread for his brothers",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Heard the giant mocking God and said, I'll go if no other",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saul gave him armor but it didn't fit the frame",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He took his staff and his sling and he went in the name",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Five smooth stones from the brook",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "One shot is all that it took",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You come with a sword and a spear",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I come in the name of the Lord, he is here",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The liar looked at David and he laughed at the kid",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Come here, I'll give your flesh to the birds, that's what he said",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "David said, you come with a sword, a spear, a javelin",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But I come in the name of the Lord of hosts, and he will win",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He ran to the line, put a stone in the sling",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let it fly to the forehead and the giant hit the ground",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The battle is the Lord's, let the whole earth know",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There's a God in Israel, and he saves without a sword",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Five smooth stones from the brook",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "One shot is all that it took",
   "heard": 7,
